{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SJj3yxU59TjHnAgsbV7wzv","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — symb_invariant_consensus\\\\n\\\\n## 环境信息 (2026-05-16)\\\\n- **服务器**: westd-32608, 账号 root\\\\n- **GPU**: NVIDIA RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell Server Edition, 98GB VRAM, cuda:0（已分配）\\\\n- **CUDA**: 12.8 (nvcc V12.8.93)\\\\n- **Python**: 3.12.3 via conda (/root/miniconda3, base 环境)\\\\n- **环境激活**: `source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`\\\\n- **关键包**: torch 2.11.0+cu130, vllm 0.20.2, z3-solver 4.15.4, sympy 1.14.0, datasets 4.8.4, math_verify 0.9.0\\\\n- **磁盘**: 根分区 16GB free, 数据盘 /root/autodl-tmp 232GB free\\\\n\\\\n## 模型信息\\\\n- **QwQ-32B**: 已���用。路径 `/root/autodl-tmp/models/QwQ-32B/Qwen/QwQ-32B/`\\\\n- **Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct** (当前活跃): 路径 `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct`，vLLM PID 174291, port 8000, max_model_len=8192, gpu_memory_utilization=0.85, 27.6 GiB VRAM\\\\n- **注意**: 14B 模型 max_model_len 设 8192（Director 指令��，不要照搬 QwQ-32B 的 16384\\\\n\\\\n## 代码修复记录\\\\n- P0-1: VLLMBackend 实现 + extraction prompt 改进（变量规范化 + few-shot）✅\\\\n- P0-2: 模型切换 QwQ-32B ✅\\\\n- P1: contradiction_rate 指标修复（题目级别 problems_with_contradictions）✅\\\\n- P1: is_equiv 数学答案等价��定（math_verify + sympy fallback）✅\\\\n- P2: trace 生成改 n=K 参数（vLLM batch）+ asyncio fallback ✅\\\\n- P2: API 重试逻辑（3次 exponential backoff）✅\\\\n- Z3 parser 全面修复: parse 成功率 56%→93% ✅\\\\n- A+C Scorer: NORMAL + FALLBACK mode ✅\\\\n- v3 timeout: 1800s ✅\\\\n- v4 修���: max_tokens 16384 + fallback extraction + finish_reason + --save-intermediates + Int/Real sort 统一 + ProofWriter prompt 适配 ✅\\\\n- **L3+L1 修复 (2026-05-16)**: answer assertion 注入 + 互斥 hard constraints + extraction system prompt + JSON-only + temperature 0.1 ✅\\\\n  - commit: `97aeaa5 fix: L3 inject answer constraints + L1 improve extraction prompt`\\\\n  - 修改文���: pipeline.py, z3_maxsat.py, constraint_extractor.py, eval_proofwriter.py\\\\n\\\\n## 关键结构性发现 (2026-05-15~16)\\\\n- **QwQ-32B 单候选主导是模型级���征**：AIME 22题 + MATH L4-5 3题 + smoke 5题 + ProofWriter 16题 + FOLIO 10题 = ~56��跨三域，multi-candidate rate = 3.6%（ProofWriter 3/16）。所有有效投票题目 K=12 条 trace 只产 1 ��候选答案。\\\\n- **Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 产生充分 trace 多样性**：C0 预检 26 题（FOLIO-10 + ProofWriter-16）多候选��� 46%（FOLIO 40%, PW 50%），对比 QwQ-32B 3.6% 提升 12.8x。非 reasoning model 的采样多样性使 SICA 有操作空间。\\\\n- **SICA 在数学域结构性等价于 SC**：只有 1 个候选时 MaxSAT 排除操作不改变最终选择���SICA≡SC，gap=0pp。\\\\n- **MaxSAT 求解器本身无 bug**：注入测试 6/6 通过。satisfied_ratio=1.000 根���是约束编码不含答���断言 + 提取失败 54.4%。\\\\n- **L3 修复有效**：注入 answer assertion 后，多候选题上 excluded>0（616_Q7=1, 251_Q10=1），SICA 在多候选场景下正确工作。\\\\n- **L1 修复有效**：提取率从 48.4% → 100%。system prompt + JSON-only + temperature 0.1 解决了 QwQ-32B 重新推理问题。\\\\n- **C0 是 D012 MVP 的真正瓶颈**：算法修复后在多候选题上能正确工作，但 QwQ-32B ��域多候选率仅 3.6%，场景太少无法产生统计显著的 accuracy gap。\\\\n- **模型适配是 SICA 的关键前置条件**：SICA 需要 trace ���样性作��输入，reasoning model（如 QwQ-32B）的确定性推理��抑制了采样随机性。非 reasoning model（如 Qwen2.5-14B）更适配 SICA 框架。\\\\n\\\\n## D012 全量评估关键发现 (2026-05-16)\\\\n- **D012 ALL PASS**: C0=53.3%, C1=100%, C2=34题, C3=+3.3pp（SICA 73.3% vs SC 70.0%）\\\\n- **SICA 优势机制 = tie-break**：4 题 SICA≠SC 全部来自 6:6 投票平局（K=12 下两 candidate 各 6 票），SICA 通过约束加权正确打破 3/4 次（75% tie-break accuracy）\\\\n- **优势集中在 FOLIO 域**：FOLIO +6.7pp (80% vs 73.3%)，ProofWriter ±0pp (66.7% vs 66.7%)——可能因 FOLIO 含更多歧义题导致平局更频繁\\\\n- **C1=100% 是 14B 模型的关键优势**：Qwen2.5-14B 完美遵循 JSON 提取指令（720/720 traces），对比 QwQ-32B ~45%，指令遵循能力是约束提取的前提\\\\n- **60 题不够统计显著**：bootstrap p=0.226，需要扩大样本量或增加域才能达 p<0.1\\\\n- **MaxSAT 排除率很低 (2.59%)**：5849 raw constraints / 1735 unique，实际被排除的比例小——SICA 不是靠\\\\\\\"大量排除错误 trace\\\\\\\"取胜，而是靠\\\\\\\"精准加权打破平局\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **论文 story 启示**：SICA 的价值定位不是\\\\\\\"找出大量矛盾并排除\\\\\\\"，而是\\\\\\\"在 SC 无法决断的平局场景中，利用符号约束一致性提供有信息量的 tie-break 信号\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## 决策记录\\\\n- QwQ-32B FP16 (~64GB) 在 98GB VRAM 上可跑，无需量化\\\\n- 使用 conda base 环境，不创建 venv\\\\n- MATH-500 子集已分层抽样 50 题（seed=42），路径: /root/symb_invariant_consensus/data/math500_subset.json\\\\n- **D016 模型 pivot (2026-05-16)**：QwQ-32B C0 全域 FAIL → 切换 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 验证算法在非 reasoning model 上的有效性。备选 72B-AWQ 若 14B SC accuracy < 70%��\\\\n- **D016 C0 PASS (2026-05-16)**：14B SC accuracy 73% ≥ 70%，多候选率 46% >> 20%。\\\\n- **D012 PASS (2026-05-16)**：全量 60 题评估通过，MVP 验证成功。SICA 在有多样性输入时有效。\\\\n\\\\n## 就绪状态\\\\n- **vLLM Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 运行中**: PID 174291, port 8000, 27.6 GiB\\\\n- **D012 MVP PASS**: 等 Director 决策下一步（扩大样本 / 消融 / 冲 EMNLP 还是退 AAAI）\\\\n- **FOLIO-30 全量暂停**: 已被 D012 覆盖（D012 含 FOLIO-30）\\\\n\\\\n## 硬规则\\\\n- **vLLM 独占**: 实验运行期间，禁止其他进程向 vLLM 发请求\\\\n- **rescore 必须纯 CPU**: 不重新生成 trace、不做 extraction、零网络请求\\\\n- **数���诚信**: 禁止手动硬编码\\\\\\\"已知旧值\\\\\\\"后自证翻转，对比数据必须从实际结果 JSON 读��\\\\n- **max_tokens ≤ 4096 (14B)**: max_model_len=8192��安全 max_tokens=4096（保留 prompt 空间）\\\\n- **只用 cuda:0**: gpu_ids=[0]，不用���他 GPU\\\\n\\\\n## 教训\\\\n- CRD ≠ SICA\\\\n- ModelScope 下载 QwQ-32B 用嵌套 cache 结构，vLLM ���指向正确路径\\\\n- max_model_len=32768 导��� engine core 初始化失败，需降到 16384\\\\n- MATH 答案比较必须用等���判定（math_verify/sympy fallback）\\\\n- rescore_full.py 错误地���生成 trace（抢 vLLM + 混淆变量）\\\\n- memory.md 是制度性记忆，不能覆写为临时分析报告\\\\n- **MaxSAT 约束编码必须含答案断言**：不注��� `answer==<ans>` 约束，不同答案 trace 的 domain constraints 可以全部满足，MaxSAT ���远 excluded=0\\\\n- **extraction prompt 必须用 system prompt + JSON-only**：QwQ-32B 等 reasoning model 收到 user prompt 后会重新推��，54.4% ��取失败\\\\n- **数学域 SICA 投���回报极低**：~56 题跨三域 0~3.6% 多候选证明 QwQ-32B trace 分歧极��\\\\n- **SICA 的模型选择至关重要**��reasoning model 自一致性过强导致 SICA≡SC，必须��非 reasoning model ���取 trace 多样性\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4944, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BX9cJsp4UGuzb4pnQ1DzKd","session_id":"8c49e676-dfc6-48dd-9895-282b92c4e684","uuid":"2cdc6df8-74ab-4520-80fe-9aee53c24f51","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:14:39.625Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01XvUgA6ySJ5eJ3Q2GVWHpiR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01A92gQKFEEpiTdF41Pes46z","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2: Novelty + Related Work review","prompt":"You are Reviewer 2 (R2) for a top ML venue review. Your focus is **novelty and related work**. Review the following paper critically and independently. Use a 6-point scale (1=Strong Reject, 2=Reject, 3=Weak Reject, 4=Weak Accept, 5=Accept, 6=Strong Accept). Target venue acceptance rate ~25%.\n\n## Paper Summary\n\n**Title:** \"Principled Symbolic Consensus Improves LLM Reasoning\"\n\n**Core idea:** SICA (Symbolic Invariant Consensus Aggregation) improves Self-Consistency (SC) for LLM reasoning by extracting first-order logic (FOL) constraints from reasoning traces and resolving voting ties via weighted partial MAX-SAT. The paper also introduces C0 (multi-candidate rate) as a zero-cost diagnostic predicting when SICA helps.\n\n**Method (Section 3):**\n- Given K reasoning traces, extract FOL constraints from each using the same LLM\n- Weight constraints by intra-trace consistency\n- Select answer via argmax over weighted constraint sums\n- C0 = fraction of questions with >1 distinct answer across traces\n- Z3 as MAX-SAT solver\n\n**Related Work (Section 2):**\n- Self-Consistency and Voting Methods: Wang et al. 2023 (SC), Chen et al. 2023 (Universal SC). Claims neither exploits logical structure within traces for consensus.\n- Symbolic Reasoning with LLMs: Pan et al. 2023 (FOL for logical reasoning), Ye et al. 2023 (symbolic solvers + neural). Claims SICA differs by using symbolic extraction for consensus aggregation rather than answer generation.\n- Ensemble and Aggregation Methods: Mentions weighted ensembles and learned verifiers. Claims SICA requires no training data.\n\n**Key results:**\n- +3.8pp over SC on 804 logic reasoning questions (p=0.023)\n- 75.9% tiebreak win rate\n- C0 predicts SICA-SC gap with r=0.94 across 4 model scales\n- Operating regime: works for instruction models (high C0), degenerates for reasoning models (low C0)\n- 39% overhead (mostly constraint extraction)\n\n**Contributions claimed:**\n1. Principled tiebreaking via symbolic constraints\n2. Operating regime characterization (when SICA helps vs degenerates)\n3. C0 as practical zero-cost diagnostic\n\n**Benchmarks:** FOLIO (204Q) + ProofWriter D5 (600Q) only — both logic reasoning.\n**Models:** Qwen2.5 family only (7B/14B/72B) + QwQ-32B.\n\n## Your Review Task\n\nProvide a structured review covering:\n\n1. **Summary** (2-3 sentences)\n2. **Strengths** (novelty, positioning, related work coverage)\n3. **Weaknesses** (novelty, related work) — be specific and critical. Consider:\n   - Is the core idea truly novel? What prior work is closest?\n   - Are important baselines/related work missing? (e.g., learned verifiers like ORM/PRM, debate/refinement methods, symbolic verification approaches, other aggregation strategies)\n   - Is the related work section fair and complete?\n   - How significant is the contribution given the scope?\n   - Is the \"operating regime\" framing genuinely new or is it a restatement of known phenomena?\n   - Domain generality: does this only work for FOL-amenable tasks?\n4. **Missing Related Work** (specific papers/methods the authors should cite or compare against)\n5. **Questions for Authors**\n6. **Minor Issues**\n7. **Preliminary Score** (1-6) with justification\n8. **Confidence** (1-5, where 5=expert)\n\nBe thorough and critical. Consider the novelty bar for a top ML venue. Do NOT be generous — identify real problems with positioning and novelty."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29561,"cache_read_input_tokens":22942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29561},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c49e676-dfc6-48dd-9895-282b92c4e684","uuid":"5169a7ac-2bf9-49b3-8d2e-04fb4152aa93"}
